      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/worked-solution": "At $t=0,$ the supplied model gives $Q(0)=\\alpha(1-0/25)+\\beta(1-0/25)^{3}=\\alpha+\\beta.$ The initial amount is $3\\,\\text{kg},$ so $\\alpha+\\beta=3.$"
